.TH MINITUND 8 "2026-08-01" "MiniTun 0.1.0" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
minitund \- MiniTun client daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B /usr/libexec/minitun/minitund
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B minitund
maintains isolated authenticated TLS sessions and Worker Pools for configured
public servers. Desired server and tunnel state is persisted in SQLite and
restored after restart. The process stays in the foreground for service-manager
supervision.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --socket " path"
Unix control socket. The default is /run/minitun/minitun.sock.
.TP
.BI --database " path"
State database. The default is /var/lib/minitun/state.db.
.TP
.BI --credentials " path"
Credential database. The default is /var/lib/minitun/credentials.db.
.TP
.BI --tls-ca " path"
PEM CA file used to verify remote server certificates. System trust is used
when this option is omitted.
.TP
.B --insecure-skip-verify
Disable remote certificate verification. This development-only option prints
a warning and must not be used in production.
.TP
.BI --relay-idle-timeout " seconds"
Close inactive relays. The default is 300 seconds.
.TP
.BI --shutdown-timeout " seconds"
Maximum graceful relay drain time. The default is 10 seconds.
.TP
.BI --max-idle-workers-per-server " count"
Per-server idle Worker limit. The default is 32.
.TP
.BI --max-total-idle-workers " count"
Daemon-wide idle Worker limit. The default is 128.
.TP
.BI --max-total-connections " count"
Daemon-wide Worker and relay limit. The default is 10000.
.TP
.BI --io-threads " count"
Asio worker thread count, from 1 through 16.
.TP
.BI --log-level " level"
Structured log level: trace, debug, info, warn, error, critical, or off.
.TP
.B --foreground
Run in the foreground. This is the packaged service mode.
.TP
.B --version
Print version information and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /run/minitun/minitun.sock
Local control socket, mode 0660.
.TP
.I /var/lib/minitun/state.db
Persistent state database, mode 0600.
.TP
.I /var/lib/minitun/credentials.db
Credential database, mode 0600.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR minitun (1),
.BR minitun-server (8),
.BR systemd.service (5)
